# "When The Meathook Massacre enters, each creature gets -X/-X": cast for {B}{B} alone, X is 0 and an Ornithopter keeps its 0/2 (no creature dies to a
# -0/-0). The drain is still live: Bot1 then Bolts its own Ornithopter and, because a creature it controls died, Bot2 loses 1 life (19).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
The Meathook Massacre
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Meathook Massacre.Cast(X: 0)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Lightning Bolt
